WEBVTT

00:00:08.610 --> 00:00:14.650
<i>Kakugane, the paranormal alloy forged</i> <i>from the essence of alchemy...</i>

00:00:15.820 --> 00:00:18.880
<i>Activated by the person's fighting instinct,</i>

00:00:19.160 --> 00:00:22.290
<i>the possessor converts</i> <i>their latent power into form</i>

00:00:22.660 --> 00:00:25.320
<i>and creates a weapon like no other.</i>

00:00:26.470 --> 00:00:29.260
<i>That is Buso Renkin.</i>

00:00:33.670 --> 00:00:39.940
<i>Captain Bravo appears before Victor III,</i>
<i>Kazuki to re-exterminate him.</i>

00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:43.810
<i>Both sides fight to the full extent</i> <i>of their power.</i>

00:00:45.080 --> 00:00:47.880
<i>Although Tokiko and Gota</i> <i>rush to the rescue,</i>

00:00:47.950 --> 00:00:51.290
<i>Kazuki continued to</i> <i>fight his own way.</i>

00:00:53.060 --> 00:00:54.890
<i>Kazuki is victorious.</i>

00:00:55.330 --> 00:00:59.630
<i>Bravo also resolves to entrust</i> <i>the future to Kazuki.</i>

00:01:02.100 --> 00:01:05.540
<i>But Warrior Chief Hiwatari,</i> <i>leader of the Re-extermination squad,</i>

00:01:05.600 --> 00:01:07.510
<i>appears before them.</i>

00:01:08.470 --> 00:01:13.240
So he managed to survive, did he?
A stubborn fellow...

00:01:27.290 --> 00:01:30.420
lnjured despite wearing the Silver Skin?
What's the meaning of this?

00:01:30.860 --> 00:01:33.030
You must have screwed up!

00:01:33.470 --> 00:01:36.160
To think the invincible Silver Skin would have a weakness.

00:01:36.570 --> 00:01:39.730
l guess this means you're not our ace in the hole against Victor now, are you?

00:01:39.970 --> 00:01:42.170
Gota, he's...?

00:01:42.310 --> 00:01:45.680
Yeah. lt's different from just ordinary pyrokinetic powers.

00:01:46.450 --> 00:01:48.310
His Buso Renkin is more than just that.

00:01:49.250 --> 00:01:51.340
I'll take care of the clean-up.

00:01:51.750 --> 00:01:53.010
Step aside, Sakimori!

00:01:55.050 --> 00:01:55.890
Bravo!

00:01:56.420 --> 00:01:59.090
Don't worry. You guys go on ahead.

00:01:59.430 --> 00:02:02.090
Hey, what are you intending to do this time?

00:02:02.460 --> 00:02:04.160
We've known each other for a long time.

00:02:04.600 --> 00:02:08.760
You should know l hate letting kids die more than anything, don't you?

00:02:09.100 --> 00:02:10.230
l see.

00:02:11.470 --> 00:02:13.840
So it appears you still haven't gotten over that.

00:02:14.640 --> 00:02:17.910
Our first and only failed mission seven years ago

00:02:17.980 --> 00:02:20.380
for the Shousei Squad we were in...

00:02:21.080 --> 00:02:24.480
The elementary school that was completely annihilated...

00:02:24.750 --> 00:02:26.310
lt wasn't completely annihilated!

00:02:38.260 --> 00:02:39.820
lt's completely destroyed!

00:02:40.070 --> 00:02:43.060
Darn it! Darn it!

00:02:43.240 --> 00:02:46.360
Nobody's alive! Some sight, huh?!

00:02:46.510 --> 00:02:51.140
l'm sorry. On account of my mistake... l'm sorry...l'm sorry...

00:02:51.780 --> 00:02:54.210
The evidence has been destroyed in the mudslide.

00:02:54.510 --> 00:02:55.850
The number of people eaten is unknown.

00:02:56.380 --> 00:02:58.850
Those not eaten have been killed by the mud and rocks.

00:02:59.390 --> 00:03:01.620
The enemy has escaped under cover of the storm...

00:03:02.960 --> 00:03:05.080
Our first time, to fail a mission...

00:03:09.330 --> 00:03:10.460
Don't give up!

00:03:11.560 --> 00:03:14.970
We have to... protect as many lives as we can!

00:03:37.460 --> 00:03:38.550
She's alive...

00:03:44.530 --> 00:03:46.230
She lived...

00:03:51.800 --> 00:03:54.870
There's no changing that a great many people died, right?!

00:03:55.440 --> 00:03:57.710
You can't continue dragging it forever, Sakimori!

00:03:58.140 --> 00:04:03.950
We're fighting in an absurd world.
Let it go! That's Victor III!

00:04:04.420 --> 00:04:05.980
These kids are hope.

00:04:06.450 --> 00:04:10.410
The hope that supported the past and the hope which will support the future!

00:04:11.220 --> 00:04:13.620
Hiwatari, withdraw on this one.

00:04:13.690 --> 00:04:15.320
Let it go, Sakimori!

00:04:15.690 --> 00:04:20.100
lf you don't, you'll end up dead before any kids will die!

00:04:20.570 --> 00:04:22.970
That was to be my intention after everything was finished.

00:04:23.770 --> 00:04:27.370
But now l have intentions of a different kind.

00:04:28.310 --> 00:04:30.670
lf it's for the sake of protecting these kids...

00:04:32.440 --> 00:04:38.040
l see. lf that's your intention, then I'll also kill with that intention.

00:04:38.350 --> 00:04:40.820
However! You won't be the first one l kill!

00:04:41.120 --> 00:04:43.150
I'll start with Victor III and the rebels!

00:04:43.690 --> 00:04:48.130
Napalm Buso Renkin!
Blaze of Glory!

00:04:50.700 --> 00:04:51.930
Eat this!

00:05:02.210 --> 00:05:03.970
A perimeter of five hundred meters,

00:05:04.040 --> 00:05:06.540
flames with an instantaneous maximum temperature of 9212°F!

00:05:11.520 --> 00:05:15.280
The kids you just shot off your mouth about protecting

00:05:15.350 --> 00:05:17.020
will be vaporized in an instant!

00:05:19.390 --> 00:05:21.420
So? Absurd, isn't it?

00:05:22.190 --> 00:05:26.190
A man who should be stronger than me shouldn't be festering forever.

00:05:26.530 --> 00:05:28.190
Let go of all the past from seven years ago

00:05:28.270 --> 00:05:31.760
and the memories of the kids here and now.

00:05:43.480 --> 00:05:45.140
What? l...?

00:05:46.420 --> 00:05:48.650
Bravo!

00:05:48.850 --> 00:05:50.620
Eat this!

00:05:57.330 --> 00:05:58.850
Bravo! This is...?!

00:05:58.930 --> 00:05:59.900
Warrior Chief!

00:05:59.970 --> 00:06:03.600
l sure put you guys through some hard times.

00:06:03.700 --> 00:06:04.760
—Bravo!
—Warrior Chief!

00:06:04.840 --> 00:06:05.600
l'm sorry.

00:06:06.370 --> 00:06:10.610
Tokiko, Kazuki... Live.

00:06:18.080 --> 00:06:19.180
Warrior Chief...

00:06:19.950 --> 00:06:21.550
Captain Bravo...

00:06:21.990 --> 00:06:23.220
Sakimori...

00:06:23.620 --> 00:06:26.090
You...bastard!

00:06:34.830 --> 00:06:36.670
How dare you do that to Bravo!

00:06:37.400 --> 00:06:38.700
Don't get carried away!

00:06:39.240 --> 00:06:41.040
lf you'd just died sooner...

00:06:41.210 --> 00:06:42.730
Sakimori wouldn't...!

00:06:46.210 --> 00:06:47.010
What's that?!

00:06:47.080 --> 00:06:48.240
Flame Assimilation!

00:06:52.450 --> 00:06:53.650
Kazuki!

00:06:58.090 --> 00:07:01.620
That's Warrior Chief Hiwatari's
Buso Renkin...

00:07:04.560 --> 00:07:05.690
Wh-What's this...?

00:07:06.130 --> 00:07:09.400
Eat this! 9212°F flames!

00:07:09.470 --> 00:07:11.370
Blaze of Glory!

00:07:11.440 --> 00:07:13.170
Energy, full blast!

00:07:14.670 --> 00:07:15.500
Kazuki!

00:07:17.340 --> 00:07:18.540
Warrior Chief!

00:07:29.890 --> 00:07:30.980
Kazuki!

00:07:34.260 --> 00:07:35.560
What's this?!

00:07:39.830 --> 00:07:40.770
Bravo...

00:07:42.470 --> 00:07:43.560
Sakimori...

00:07:43.770 --> 00:07:44.570
That's enough!

00:07:47.910 --> 00:07:48.770
What?!

00:07:48.840 --> 00:07:51.000
This is Shousei's Buso Renkin!

00:08:00.090 --> 00:08:01.180
Bravo!

00:08:01.890 --> 00:08:02.950
ls that...?

00:08:03.020 --> 00:08:05.890
The Great Warrior Chief...
Shousei Sakaguchi...

00:08:22.710 --> 00:08:24.540
First aid treatment is complete.

00:08:24.910 --> 00:08:28.110
There's no threat to his life as long as he gets bed rest.

00:08:28.950 --> 00:08:30.470
l see. That's great!

00:08:30.650 --> 00:08:32.310
However, even if he recovers...

00:08:32.380 --> 00:08:34.510
he won't be able to fight like before.

00:08:34.990 --> 00:08:37.120
Man, he's reckless, so.

00:08:37.190 --> 00:08:37.950
You!

00:08:38.160 --> 00:08:39.180
What?!

00:08:39.260 --> 00:08:40.280
Enough of that.

00:08:40.490 --> 00:08:42.290
But Shousei...

00:08:42.530 --> 00:08:45.330
l like the familiarity of that way of addressing me

00:08:45.400 --> 00:08:48.560
but call me Great Warrior Chief in front of young subordinates.

00:08:50.870 --> 00:08:55.070
lt's been seven years and you're both all grown up now.

00:08:55.740 --> 00:08:58.870
And when l try leaving things to you guys thinking it's about time you do well...

00:08:59.180 --> 00:09:01.840
Then don't be showing up if you've left things to us!

00:09:02.050 --> 00:09:04.280
The elder should just sip tea on the balcony.

00:09:09.420 --> 00:09:12.120
Excuse me, can l ask you one thing?

00:09:12.560 --> 00:09:13.550
What is it?

00:09:14.830 --> 00:09:18.130
Why did you, the Great Warrior Chief himself, come here?

00:09:18.400 --> 00:09:20.920
By any chance, have the circumstances changed?

00:09:21.070 --> 00:09:24.060
Yes. Last night, we once again caught up with Victor.

00:09:25.440 --> 00:09:27.600
We're presently making our final charge,

00:09:27.670 --> 00:09:30.580
heading for the battlefield specially prepared on the Pacific Ocean.

00:09:36.080 --> 00:09:37.740
Frequency from Victor has been detected.

00:09:38.520 --> 00:09:40.820
Gain is stable, Captain.

00:09:41.250 --> 00:09:42.740
Enlarge to the main monitor.

00:09:42.960 --> 00:09:43.750
Aye-aye!

00:09:53.100 --> 00:09:57.590
This vessel shall continue to track movements of Victor l.

00:09:57.670 --> 00:09:59.160
—Aye-aye!
—Aye-aye!

00:10:04.710 --> 00:10:08.370
And then we convened all available warriors,

00:10:08.450 --> 00:10:11.710
but could not make contact with the all-important Sakimori and the others.

00:10:12.420 --> 00:10:16.080
l felt uneasy and then... when l came here, just as l feared...

00:10:16.990 --> 00:10:20.890
Sakimori is unable to fight, which is a setback to be honest.

00:10:21.590 --> 00:10:23.030
But we must not miss this opportunity.

00:10:24.900 --> 00:10:26.160
lt's time for the showdown.

00:10:26.370 --> 00:10:27.300
The showdown?

00:10:27.370 --> 00:10:30.340
Therefore, as of this moment, all missions are suspended.

00:10:31.540 --> 00:10:34.770
From here on, the showdown with Victor shall become top priority.

00:10:35.270 --> 00:10:36.610
Suspended?!

00:10:36.910 --> 00:10:37.840
Do you object?

00:10:37.940 --> 00:10:39.000
Darn right!

00:10:39.340 --> 00:10:42.680
The bull's eye is standing right there looking foolish in front of me.

00:10:43.080 --> 00:10:45.550
lt wouldn't be too late after killing him quickly.

00:10:45.620 --> 00:10:47.250
lf you want to fight, I'll fight.

00:10:47.420 --> 00:10:50.480
Just staring at your face pisses me off!

00:10:50.760 --> 00:10:51.690
Fine by me!

00:10:52.020 --> 00:10:53.820
I'll make you feel the same pain as Bravo did!

00:10:53.890 --> 00:10:54.790
Don't, Kazuki!

00:10:54.990 --> 00:10:56.050
Let's go!

00:10:56.160 --> 00:10:57.630
Let's continue where we left off!

00:11:00.300 --> 00:11:02.600
l told you missions are suspended.

00:11:08.540 --> 00:11:09.410
Kazuki!

00:11:09.470 --> 00:11:10.240
That's terrible...

00:11:12.280 --> 00:11:13.680
This is what happens

00:11:13.750 --> 00:11:15.300
when you don't listen to the Great Warrior Chief.

00:11:15.550 --> 00:11:16.610
Please remember that.

00:11:17.020 --> 00:11:17.850
Yes, sir!

00:11:18.250 --> 00:11:20.620
Now then, Victor III, Kazuki Muto.

00:11:21.720 --> 00:11:22.740
Due to these circumstances,

00:11:22.820 --> 00:11:25.120
your re-extermination shall be temporarily suspended.

00:11:25.860 --> 00:11:29.850
However, that doesn't mean l can just leave you on the loose.

00:11:30.460 --> 00:11:33.660
Warriors Tokiko and Gota...

00:11:34.130 --> 00:11:36.660
l order you to keep watch over
Kazuki Muto.

00:11:37.470 --> 00:11:39.300
Hey, just a minute, Shousei--!

00:11:39.870 --> 00:11:41.900
The two are no longer rebels.

00:11:43.340 --> 00:11:45.970
l get it! All right! lsn't that great, Gota?!

00:11:46.450 --> 00:11:48.240
lsn't that great, Tokiko?

00:11:48.450 --> 00:11:49.510
You could say that.

00:11:49.680 --> 00:11:52.950
However, that doesn't change the fact that you're in a difficult situation.

00:11:53.090 --> 00:11:54.080
That's still fine!

00:12:00.330 --> 00:12:02.160
lt appears the medical team has come.

00:12:12.370 --> 00:12:13.340
Great Warrior Chief!

00:12:14.440 --> 00:12:15.460
What is it?

00:12:16.410 --> 00:12:19.140
l leave Bravo...to you.

00:12:20.350 --> 00:12:23.180
There's no need for you, an enemy, to tell me that.

00:12:24.220 --> 00:12:29.280
More importantly, your remaining time that
Sakimori risked his own life to protect...

00:12:29.350 --> 00:12:31.350
use it in a meaningful way.

00:12:44.670 --> 00:12:48.160
Shousei, aren't you being a little soft?

00:12:48.570 --> 00:12:51.480
l must not take an amateur who can't obey orders

00:12:51.540 --> 00:12:53.710
to an important showdown.

00:12:53.880 --> 00:12:55.010
But...

00:12:55.680 --> 00:12:57.740
Besides, we're shorthanded.

00:12:58.250 --> 00:13:01.380
So we have to utilize the right people in the right places.

00:13:02.250 --> 00:13:04.590
Sakimori's your favorite,

00:13:04.660 --> 00:13:07.290
so l understand you wanting to take his feelings into consideration, but...

00:13:07.760 --> 00:13:09.230
You don't agree?

00:13:09.660 --> 00:13:13.790
No. We are dealing with absurdity.

00:13:14.270 --> 00:13:16.670
Of course, things don't go as planned.

00:13:18.400 --> 00:13:20.870
You've grown up quite a bit, eh?

00:13:22.310 --> 00:13:29.340
But you started using the word "absurdity" after that rainy day...

00:13:29.410 --> 00:13:31.850
Are you aware of that?

00:13:35.750 --> 00:13:39.660
lt seems Sakimori wasn't the only one who hasn't let go?

00:13:45.760 --> 00:13:47.360
<i>There's one survivor.</i>

00:13:47.830 --> 00:13:48.990
<i>Just this child.</i>

00:13:51.670 --> 00:13:53.160
<i>She's extremely weak</i>

00:13:53.240 --> 00:13:56.400
<i>and it doesn't look like she'll be able</i> <i>to hold on until general rescue comes.</i>

00:13:57.340 --> 00:13:58.610
<i>l don't want to let her die!</i>

00:14:03.110 --> 00:14:07.140
<i>Very well. She will be under</i> <i>the Army's protection for the time being.</i>

00:14:08.620 --> 00:14:09.850
<i>We're pulling out.</i>

00:14:10.720 --> 00:14:12.020
<i>Let's go, Hiwatari.</i>

00:14:14.690 --> 00:14:15.660
<i>Hiwatari?</i>

00:14:19.460 --> 00:14:21.230
Oh, yes. And also...

00:14:21.300 --> 00:14:24.270
all of my subordinates are huge favorites of mine.

00:15:04.740 --> 00:15:06.110
Alchemist Warriors...!

00:15:18.720 --> 00:15:20.780
lt appears Victor has picked up on our vessel!

00:15:21.090 --> 00:15:22.120
He is approaching!

00:15:22.330 --> 00:15:23.390
Submerge quickly.

00:15:23.500 --> 00:15:24.390
Aye-aye!

00:15:35.410 --> 00:15:37.710
Victor is pursuing in the water!

00:15:38.140 --> 00:15:39.770
All crew prepare for battle.

00:15:39.840 --> 00:15:41.180
Captain! Then...!

00:15:41.950 --> 00:15:44.820
The Army underestimates our power.

00:15:45.250 --> 00:15:47.550
No matter how formidable Victor may be,

00:15:47.620 --> 00:15:50.520
if we're in the water, this submarine's Busorenkin,

00:15:50.590 --> 00:15:53.110
the Deep Blessing, has an opportunity to win!

00:16:04.000 --> 00:16:07.560
Send a wire to the Army headquarters!
We will engage Victor.

00:16:07.640 --> 00:16:08.200
Aye-aye!

00:16:08.270 --> 00:16:09.640
Load torpedoes!

00:16:10.110 --> 00:16:11.510
Line up the bearing...

00:16:12.410 --> 00:16:13.880
—Fire!
—Fire!

00:16:21.590 --> 00:16:22.550
All shots hit!

00:16:23.020 --> 00:16:23.920
Locate the target.

00:16:38.700 --> 00:16:40.300
The target is unharmed!

00:16:40.710 --> 00:16:41.570
Load torpedoes again!

00:16:41.640 --> 00:16:44.440
Please wait! Wh-What is that?!

00:16:53.720 --> 00:16:54.620
A ghost ship?!

00:16:54.820 --> 00:16:56.410
ls Victor controlling it?

00:17:00.560 --> 00:17:01.530
Do not get discouraged!

00:17:01.790 --> 00:17:03.890
Deep Breathing, full speed ahead!

00:17:04.200 --> 00:17:05.490
We'll ram into it and tear it apart!

00:17:16.470 --> 00:17:17.340
Damage report!

00:17:17.740 --> 00:17:20.040
The vessel has made no impact!

00:17:20.410 --> 00:17:21.440
lt can't be...!

00:17:26.120 --> 00:17:28.210
Captain! We've lost control of the vessel!

00:17:28.590 --> 00:17:31.390
Something! Some kind of mysterious power is at work!

00:17:42.830 --> 00:17:45.570
All Alchemist Warriors shall be gone!

00:17:54.780 --> 00:17:58.510
Did you think this Deep Breathing was just an ordinary Buso Renkin?!

00:17:58.850 --> 00:18:00.010
Change!

00:18:02.350 --> 00:18:03.840
We are the ones who weaved together

00:18:03.920 --> 00:18:07.260
a Buso Renkin combining three kakugane into one!

00:18:07.330 --> 00:18:10.020
That combination is three kakugane and six transformations!

00:18:10.130 --> 00:18:12.320
This is the aerial battle form!

00:18:12.460 --> 00:18:14.060
—Formation!
—Formation!

00:18:22.740 --> 00:18:23.670
Verify the battle situation!

00:18:23.740 --> 00:18:25.230
The enemy ship is right in front of us!

00:18:25.380 --> 00:18:26.000
lt's coming!

00:18:26.080 --> 00:18:26.910
Forward!

00:18:27.550 --> 00:18:28.810
Activate the bow drill!

00:18:29.110 --> 00:18:30.010
Activating!

00:18:38.090 --> 00:18:39.890
—Yes!
—All right!

00:18:39.960 --> 00:18:41.650
Wh-What? Where's Victor?!

00:18:45.830 --> 00:18:49.200
Perish, alchemist warriors!

00:19:00.810 --> 00:19:02.940
Send a wire to the regiment headquarters.

00:19:03.180 --> 00:19:05.740
We could not defeat Victor and will retreat.

00:19:05.950 --> 00:19:06.850
Aye-aye.

00:19:06.920 --> 00:19:09.010
Too bad, Captain...

00:19:09.090 --> 00:19:10.610
Yes, it's too bad.

00:19:10.890 --> 00:19:14.120
We couldn't display the remaining four forms...

00:19:32.140 --> 00:19:33.840
Battle has already commenced.

00:19:34.580 --> 00:19:37.170
We are in a disadvantageous situation early on.

00:19:37.420 --> 00:19:38.970
We'll make a comeback from here on, right?

00:19:39.320 --> 00:19:42.580
However, our battle strength is presently dropping.

00:19:43.220 --> 00:19:46.620
So it seems, you jerks!
Are you going to lie there forever?!

00:19:46.690 --> 00:19:48.420
—Get up already!
—Lord Hiwatari!

00:19:48.890 --> 00:19:50.290
Listen up, you jerks!

00:19:50.360 --> 00:19:52.190
From here on, you are not a Re-extermination squad.

00:19:52.300 --> 00:19:55.230
All members are re-enlisted into a Victor Hunt Squad!

00:19:55.570 --> 00:19:56.260
Let's go!

00:19:57.270 --> 00:19:58.570
Hey! Busujima.

00:19:58.870 --> 00:19:59.500
Yes?

00:19:59.770 --> 00:20:03.500
We'll be going with our combination attack next time!

00:20:03.580 --> 00:20:05.840
Y-Yes sir! Please do that!

00:20:07.950 --> 00:20:09.240
lt still isn't clear...

00:20:09.310 --> 00:20:13.750
who the person that appeared before me at that time was.

00:20:14.190 --> 00:20:16.180
A strange man and an underground space.

00:20:16.350 --> 00:20:18.150
lt is indeed filled with mystery.

00:20:18.620 --> 00:20:21.390
That is where l got Kazuki's kakugane.

00:20:21.530 --> 00:20:24.360
l'm sure the secret behind the black kakugane is also there as well.

00:20:25.130 --> 00:20:27.220
Bravo sacrificed himself to save my life.

00:20:27.900 --> 00:20:31.130
